 "text": "Hello there! How's your day? Lovely. Dogs make wonderful picnic companions. Do you want to call him Max or something shorter like Maxie? No problem. How's everything at home? Ha, my flight's tomorrow. I thought we were still on for today. So, back to the dog. Call him by his name and let him come to a call. Sure thing. Take care of yourself at the picnic, too. No worries. Pick up where we left off later. Good to check. Probably best to keep him on a short leash around strangers for now.",
